{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30275","headline":"送李蕴赴郑州因献卢郎中 · 薛逢","name":"送李蕴赴郑州因献卢郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仆射陂西想到时，满川晴色见旌旗。\n马融闲卧笛声远，王粲醉吟楼影移。\n几日赋诗秋水寺，经年草诏白云司。\n唯君此去人多羡，却是恩深自不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30275.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30275","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}